<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound average o/n higher, one-week narrow.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound average o/n higher, one-week narrow.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose slightly in a moderately liquid private sector market on Tuesday to about eight percent from 7-13/16 percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>Some bankers said they dealt at between 7-1/2 and 8-1/4 percent compared to 7-1/2 and eight percent on Monday.</p>
<p>One-week rates narrowed to between 7-3/4 and 8-1/4 percent from 7-1/8 and 8-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
